  "zipball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/DataDog/datadog-lambda-python/zipball/v8.129.0",
  "body": ">[!IMPORTANT]\r\n> For Python 3.8 and 3.9: `dd-trace-py` version is [v3.19.9](https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-py/releases/tag/v3.19.9)\r\n> For Python >= 3.10: `dd-trace-py` version is [v4.16.0](https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-py/releases/tag/v4.16.0)\r\n\r\n\r\n>[!IMPORTANT]\r\n> This layer is currently unavailable in aws region `me-south-1`, due to unrelated incidents\r\n\r\n## What's Changed\r\n* V8.129.0.dev0 by @joeyzhao2018 in https://github.com/DataDog/datadog-lambda-python/pull/859\r\n* feat: add support for event bridge DSM context extraction by @jeastham1993 in https://github.com/DataDog/datadog-lambda-python/pull/836\r\n* fix(deps): allow wrapt 2.x by @purple4reina in https://github.com/DataDog/datadog-lambda-python/pull/862\r\n* Upgrade version to v129 by @rithikanarayan in https://github.com/DataDog/datadog-lambda-python/pull/867\r\n\r\n## New Contributors\r\n* @jeastham1993 made their first contribution in https://github.com/DataDog/datadog-lambda-python/pull/836\r\n\r\n### Layers\r\n```\r\n# AWS Commercial\r\narn:aws:lambda:<AWS_REGION>:464622532012:layer:Datadog-Python38:129\r\narn:aws:lambda:<AWS_REGION>:464622532012:layer:Datadog-Python38-ARM:129\r\narn:aws:lambda:<AWS_REGION>:464622532012:layer:Datadog-Python39:129\r\narn:aws:lambda:<AWS_REGION>:464622532012:layer:Datadog-Python39-ARM:129\r\narn:aws:lambda:<AWS_REGION>:464622532012:layer:Datadog-Python310:129\r\narn:aws:lambda:<AWS_REGION>:464622532012:layer:Datadog-Python310-ARM:129\r\narn:aws:lambda:<AWS_REGION>:464622532012:layer:Datadog-Python311:129\r\narn:aws:lambda:<AWS_REGION>:464622532012:layer:Datadog-Python311-ARM:129\r\narn:aws:lambda:<AWS_REGION>:464622532012:layer:Datadog-Python312:129\r\narn:aws:lambda:<AWS_REGION>:464622532012:layer:Datadog-Python312-ARM:129\r\narn:aws:lambda:<AWS_REGION>:464622532012:layer:Datadog-Python313:129\r\narn:aws:lambda:<AWS_REGION>:464622532012:layer:Datadog-Python313-ARM:129\r\narn:aws:lambda:<AWS_REGION>:464622532012:layer:Datadog-Python314:129\r\narn:aws:lambda:<AWS_REGION>:464622532012:layer:Datadog-Python314-ARM:129\r\n\r\n# AWS GovCloud \r\narn:aws-us-gov:lambda:us-gov-<AWS_REGION>:<ACCOUNT>:layer:Datadog-Python38:129\r\narn:aws-us-gov:lambda:us-gov-<AWS_REGION>:<ACCOUNT>:layer:Datadog-Python38-ARM:129\r\narn:aws-us-gov:lambda:us-gov-<AWS_REGION>:<ACCOUNT>:layer:Datadog-Python39:129\r\narn:aws-us-gov:lambda:us-gov-<AWS_REGION>:<ACCOUNT>:layer:Datadog-Python39-ARM:129\r\narn:aws-us-gov:lambda:us-gov-<AWS_REGION>:<ACCOUNT>:layer:Datadog-Python310:129\r\narn:aws-us-gov:lambda:us-gov-<AWS_REGION>:<ACCOUNT>:layer:Datadog-Python310-ARM:129\r\narn:aws-us-gov:lambda:us-gov-<AWS_REGION>:<ACCOUNT>:layer:Datadog-Python311:129\r\narn:aws-us-gov:lambda:us-gov-<AWS_REGION>:<ACCOUNT>:layer:Datadog-Python311-ARM:129\r\narn:aws-us-gov:lambda:us-gov-<AWS_REGION>:<ACCOUNT>:layer:Datadog-Python312:129\r\narn:aws-us-gov:lambda:us-gov-<AWS_REGION>:<ACCOUNT>:layer:Datadog-Python312-ARM:129\r\narn:aws-us-gov:lambda:us-gov-<AWS_REGION>:<ACCOUNT>:layer:Datadog-Python313:129\r\narn:aws-us-gov:lambda:us-gov-<AWS_REGION>:<ACCOUNT>:layer:Datadog-Python313-ARM:129\r\narn:aws-us-gov:lambda:us-gov-<AWS_REGION>:<ACCOUNT>:layer:Datadog-Python314:129\r\narn:aws-us-gov:lambda:us-gov-<AWS_REGION>:<ACCOUNT>:layer:Datadog-Python314-ARM:129\r\n\r\nACCOUNT =\r\n002406178527 for us1 environment\r\n486696501492 for us2 environment\r\n```\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/DataDog/datadog-lambda-python/compare/v8.128.0...v8.129.0\r\n\r\n",
